---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import SourcesNote from "../components/SourcesNote.astro";
import { careers, figures, projects } from "../data/site";
---

<Layout
  title="Corridor"
  description="The Cedar Creek data center corridor: EdgeConneX under construction and the Pacifico and BlackChamber campus paying full property taxes."
>
  <PageHero
    kicker="The corridor"
    title="Cedar Creek is where the tax base is being built."
    lede={`Two campuses. ${figures.combinedInvestment} in combined investment. One pays a discounted tax on the way to a full commercial value. The other withdrew its abatement and is published at a full-rate bill.`}
  />

  <article class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-14 md:px-6 md:py-20">
    <div class="space-y-8">
      {
        projects.map((project) => (
          <section id={project.id} class="scroll-mt-24 rounded-[2rem] border border-line bg-paper p-6 md:p-10">
            <p class="kicker">{project.place}</p>
            <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3">
              <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl">{project.name}</h2>
              <p class="rounded-full bg-sand px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium">{project.status}</p>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">{project.summary}</p>
            <dl class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:grid-cols-4">
              {project.stats.map((stat) => (
                <div class="border-t border-line pt-3">
                  <dt class="text-xs tracking-wide text-muted uppercase">{stat.label}</dt>
                  <dd class="font-mono mt-1 text-lg text-pine">{stat.value}</dd>
                </div>
              ))}
            </dl>
          </section>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <section class="copy mt-12 max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl text-ink">Read the two tax postures separately</h2>
      <p>
        EdgeConneX is under construction. Its phase-one building is the {figures.edgePhase} start of a campus planned
        above {figures.edgeFull}. The abatement is real, and so is the published result during that abatement: more
        than {figures.edgeAbatementPublic} to the county and Bastrop ISD, against {figures.priorAnnualTax} a year from
        the land before. Tomorrow Begins Here’s ISD projection for the proposal is {figures.isdAnnualProjection} a
        year.
      </p>
      <p>
        Pacifico is the full-freight case. Chapter 312 and JETI requests were withdrawn. The published bill is {figures.pacificoAnnualTax} a year, described as {figures.pacificoCountyShare} of county revenue, from a {figures.pacificoInvestment} campus on {figures.pacificoAcres}. Building Bastrop County also notes reported
        talks with Anthropic, the company behind Claude, about leasing space. Reported interest is not an announced
        lease.
      </p>
      <p>
        The power designs differ too. Pacifico’s {figures.pacificoPower} plant is on the property. EdgeConneX’s figure
        of up to {figures.edgeCapacity} is campus capacity, not a claim that the building generates its own electricity.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-16">
      <p class="kicker">Careers</p>
      <h2 class="font-display mt-3 text-4xl">The jobs are real. They are not the main event.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Headcount is the wrong scoreboard, and it is still a good set of jobs. Each construction phase is published
        at {figures.constructionJobs} people. Permanent roles land in a band of {figures.payRange}, and most of the
        technician paths do not require a four-year degree. Austin Community College and Texas State Technical College
        are the local routes named for certificates that can be finished in under a year, alongside CompTIA and Cisco
        networking programs.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-8 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2">
        {
          careers.map((job) => (
            <li class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper p-5">
              <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3">
                <h3 class="font-medium">{job.role}</h3>
                <p class="font-mono text-xs text-copper-deep">{job.pay}</p>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{job.note}</p>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </section>

    <SourcesNote />
  </article>
</Layout>
